   ((mR L).headD 0) (bit1 (mR L)) (bit2 (mR L)) ((eReg L).headD 0)
   (cacheWire L) (hostWire L) (host2Wire L)
 exact ⟨cap.1.trans carrier,cap.2.trans carrier⟩

