 ExtraLeTwo (rho.symm L.core.sumCarry) (rho.symm (bit1 L.core.high)) (hostedBody L rho c) (bBody L c):=by
 have h:=bodyV_rel (hostLayout L rho) (host_widths L hw rho) c (rho.symm (bit1 L.core.high))
